# Thieves Guild: bounty and prison. "price on your head": only Phane Rielle (Balmora, South Wall), Tongue-Toad
# (Ald'ruhn, Rat In The Pot), Rissinia (Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's) and Arantamo (Vivec, Simine Fralinie's) clear
# a bounty for a guild member -- "Thanks. I'll pay it." 1 takes CrimeGoldDiscount (fCrimeGoldDiscountMult 0.5 of
# it), SetPCCrimeLevel 0, PayFineThief (the stolen goods stay); any other member only points to them (Habasi).
# Prison: a Hlaalu guard in Balmora's Eastern Guard Tower, to a player who turns in with a bounty, offers "Go to
# Jail." 2: GotoJail, then the engine jails the player and serves the sentence (game_calls_crime ServeSentence).
# SetPCCrimeLevel stands in for a crime seen; the gold is set to exactly 1000 to read the price paid.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance --instance 2 mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_a1_11_report --timeout 3600
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tg_bounty_master_refers
run
SetPCCrimeLevel 1000
player->PositionCell -242 650 9 0 "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, South Wall Cornerclub" == 1
approach 05B9FAAA
talk habasi
ask price on your head
expect GetPCCrimeLevel == 1000
bye
end

case tg_bounty_phane_rielle
run
SetPCCrimeLevel 1000
player->RemoveItem Gold_001 10000000
player->AddItem Gold_001 1000
approach 052A6AD7
talk phane rielle
ask price on your head
choose 1
expect GetPCCrimeLevel == 0
expect player->GetItemCount Gold_001 == 500
bye
end

case tg_bounty_tongue_toad
run
SetPCCrimeLevel 1000
player->RemoveItem Gold_001 10000000
player->AddItem Gold_001 1000
player->PositionCell -128 700 -480 0 "Ald-ruhn, The Rat In The Pot"
until 300 GetPCCell "Ald-ruhn, The Rat In The Pot" == 1
approach 05B948EC
talk tongue_toad
ask price on your head
choose 1
expect GetPCCrimeLevel == 0
expect player->GetItemCount Gold_001 == 500
bye
end

case tg_bounty_rissinia
run
SetPCCrimeLevel 1000
player->RemoveItem Gold_001 10000000
player->AddItem Gold_001 1000
player->PositionCell -312 -420 140 0 "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub"
until 300 GetPCCell "Sadrith Mora, Dirty Muriel's Cornerclub" == 1
approach 05995A1C
talk rissinia
ask price on your head
choose 1
expect GetPCCrimeLevel == 0
expect player->GetItemCount Gold_001 == 500
bye
end

case tg_bounty_arantamo
run
SetPCCrimeLevel 1000
player->RemoveItem Gold_001 10000000
player->AddItem Gold_001 1000
player->PositionCell 6314 -600 -251 0 "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller"
until 300 GetPCCell "Vivec, Simine Fralinie: Bookseller" == 1
approach 059862E5
talk arantamo
ask price on your head
choose 1
expect GetPCCrimeLevel == 0
expect player->GetItemCount Gold_001 == 500
bye
end

case tg_prison
run
player->PositionCell 3749 4080 15797 0 "Balmora, Eastern Guard Tower"
until 300 GetPCCell "Balmora, Eastern Guard Tower" == 1
run
SetPCCrimeLevel 300
approach 05651DB3
talk 05651DB3
choose 2
bye
until 1200 GetPCCrimeLevel == 0
until 600 GetPCCell "Balmora, Eastern Guard Tower" == 0
end
